Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:20:25 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Cache immutable shader table binding plans

Adapt the metadata-only TablePlan from avatarmanz/VIctory-7900XTX 46e32978188d2a82e1723f31cfe42c799751dee7. Preserve direct declaration order, first duplicate descriptor selection, current root bindings, host heap identity, and dynamic lease ownership. Keep checked invalid-maximum fallback for snapshot selection. Four new metadata regressions and existing descriptor ownership checks pass; runtime performance is not yet measured.
